    "title": {
      "en": "About COOLINKEY",
      "zh": "关于 COOLINKEY"
    },
    "body": {
      "en": "COOLINKEY builds smart security for bicycles and daily carry—combining fingerprint access, a tough sleeved chain, and app connectivity so you can lock up quickly and get back to riding.",
      "zh": "COOLINKEY 专注自行车与随身场景的智能安防，将指纹解锁、高强度包覆链条与 App 互联结合，让你快速上锁、回到骑行与都市生活。"
    }
  },
